message: "For the repository's Lean code and combined formal development, cite this software record. For an individual mathematical paper, use its result-specific article citation in joint/, anisotropic/, high-temperature/, or low-temperature/. See docs/EVIDENCE_AND_REPRODUCIBILITY.md for the Reader manuscripts and exact versions."
type: software
title: "Natural boundaries of the square-lattice Ising susceptibility: joint independent-complex-coupling, anisotropic, high-temperature and low-temperature results"
